{"run_id": "20260815T221206-hepkg-48559", "qid": "gen-concept-c1a60b31", "repeat": 1, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "021bd22315cb", "git_sha": "c209974-dirty", "question": "Count the analyses that measured f_a3 (CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section).", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The graph records 22 analyses that measured observables related to the CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section, specifically the CP-mixing angle \\( \\tan(\\alpha) \\) in the effective Higgs-gluon (Hgg) coupling. Here are some of the papers that measured this observable:\n\n1. **$\\\\sigma(t\\\\bar{t}W^{+})$ measurement result**\n2. **$\\\\sigma(t\\\\bar{t}W^{-})$ measurement result**\n3. **Combination and interpretation of differential Higgs boson production cross sections in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n4. **Constraints on Higgs boson production with large transverse momentum using $H\\\\rightarrow b\\\\bar{b}$ decays in the ATLAS detector**\n5. **Differential cross section measurements for the production of top quark pairs and of additional jets using dilepton events from ${\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}{\\\\mathup{{{p}}}}$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13\\\\,\\\\text{Te\\\\hskip-0.80002ptV}$**\n6. **Inclusive and differential cross-section measurements of $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production in $pp$ collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV with the ATLAS detector, including EFT and spin-correlation interpretations**\n\nThese papers cover a range of topics, including top quark pair production, Higgs boson production, and $t\\\\bar{t}Z$ production.\n\nTo summarize, the graph records 22 distinct analyses that measured the CP-mixing angle \\( \\tan(\\alpha) \\) in the effective Higgs-gluon (Hgg) coupling, which is related to the CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section.\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"answer\", \"arguments\": {\"text\": \"The graph records 22 distinct analyses that measured the CP-mixing angle \\( \\\\tan(\\\\alpha) \\) in the effective Higgs-gluon (Hgg) coupling, which is related to the CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section. These analyses include measurements of top quark pair production, Higgs boson production, and \\( t\\\\bar{t}Z \\) production.\", \"answerable\": true, \"reason\": \"answered\"}}\n</tool_call>", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2004.14060", "2007.02873", "2008.05928", "2009.14537", "2012.03799", "2103.04956", "2109.13808", "2110.11231", "2111.08340", "2201.11585", "2206.09466", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2302.05225", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2403.01556", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2503.19420", "2504.13081", "2602.18611"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "f_a3", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 21, "error": null, "seconds": 0.126}, {"round": 2, "tool": "search", "args": {"text": "CP-odd HVV effective fractional cross section", "kind": "observable"}, "rows": 60, "error": null, "seconds": 0.212}, {"round": 3, "tool": "count", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_2"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "seconds": 0.047}, {"round": 4, "tool": "subjects_of", "args": {"predicate": "result_measures_observable", "object_set": "set_2"}, "rows": 65, "error": null, "seconds": 0.017}], "sets": {"set_1": ["hepkg:observable:AC_llbar", "hepkg:observable:AC_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:br_h_etau", "hepkg:observable:coupling_modifier_resolved", "hepkg:observable:higgs_branching_fraction_ratio", "hepkg:observable:higgs_signal_strength_per_decay", "hepkg:observable:luminosity_calibration_factor", "hepkg:observable:mu-h-fiducial", "hepkg:observable:mu_fermion_vector", "hepkg:observable:njet012_vs_m_ttbar_vs_yabs_ttbar", "hepkg:observable:pt_b3", "hepkg:observable:scale_factor_b", "hepkg:observable:scale_factor_c", "hepkg:observable:sigma-h-fiducial", "hepkg:observable:smeft_wilson_c